      "content": "I am initiating a diagnostic routine on the fans in the Permian Basin sector immediately to pinpoint the source of the elevated energy draw. Regarding the \"manual transition,\" I do have preliminary concerns about process stability; switching to manual control could temporarily impact the fine-tuned optimization parameters we've established. I will provide a detailed impact assessment on the current optimization path before the executive schedule is finalized.",
